    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inescaped Paranoia</strong> is a psychological horror game where paranoia is your worst enemy. As a building inspector sent to assess an abandoned farmhouse, your routine job quickly turns into a descent into fear and uncertainty. The house shifts, your mind distorts reality, and soon, escape feels impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve environmental puzzles, uncover hidden truths, and survive a series of psychological trials that test your sanity.</strong> But be warned\u2014some horrors exist only in your head, and others are all too real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it out, or will you become just another failed victim?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle-Based Horror</strong> \u2013 Solve cryptic challenges while uncovering the farmhouse\u2019s dark past.<br>\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Camera Exploration</strong> \u2013 Some things can only be seen through the lens.<br>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Psychological Mind Games</strong> \u2013 Your surroundings are not what they seem.<br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Unpredictable Horror</strong> \u2013 Randomized jumpscares and disturbing events keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your fears. Escape the nightmare. If you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Inescaped Paranoia</p>",
